  "title": "nettrace: fix Coverity unsafe_xml_parse_config issue",
  "description": "Fix Coverity unsafe_xml_parse_config.\n\n```\nCID 1668259: (#1 of 1): unsafe_xml_parse_config (UNSAFE_XML_PARSE_CONFIG)\nunsafe_xml_parse_config: XML parse option should not have flag XML_PARSE_NOENT set, which is vulnerable to XML external entity attack\n```\n\nnettrace 3gpp_32_423 xml format does not consider entities. Trace files are single xml files.\n\nExample: [3GPP_Trace_Report_File.xml](/uploads/1a15af2e5b00cca9477e1801e3385a47/3GPP_Trace_Report_File.xml)\n\n[Schema](https://www.3gpp.org/ftp/specs/archive/32_series/32.423/schema): [32423-740-XMLSchema.zip](/uploads/b01b636b71eba0dcfbe15d855a0e7a2f/32423-740-XMLSchema.zip)",
