    {
      "id": "6193c6141a3a1608a07235682458d36dcc3523f7",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3122577975,
          "type": null,
          "body": "It is very strange, @mmann78. I received the email about your comment but I cannot see here within the MR. any idea why?\n\nSo it is unclear why you mean under \"code analysis tool doesn't like it\".\n\nI have only done a very small change, I removed `XML_PARSE_NOENT` because it is a security risk.\n\n`doc = xmlReadFile(wth->pathname, NULL, XML_PARSE_NOENT | XML_PARSE_NONET | XML_PARSE_NOERROR);`\n\nnettrace reads in xml files which follow the 3gpp standard xsd format. That format does not allow entities to be defined in the xml file and external entities therefore shall not be considered at all. This means removing the related XML_PARSE_NOENT flag.\n\nI don't see why this is a problem to any code analysis tool. I have not changed anything else.",
          "author": {
            "id": 20971927,
            "username": "rtommy",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Tamas Regos",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/20971927/avatar.png?v=1788090511",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rtommy"
          },
          "created_at": "2026-03-01T15:21:24.393Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-03-01T15:21:24.393Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 459909553,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
